OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Met Police officer trained to
OL,4,Asupport rape victims accused of rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Metropolitan Police officer
OL,7,Faccused of raping a woman was specially
OL,8,Ftrained to deal with victims of sexual
OL,9,Foffences, a court has heard.
OL,11,FMark Tyrrell, 57, denies two counts of
OL,12,Frape, 11 of sexual assault and four of
OL,13,Fassault by penetration against the
OL,14,Fwoman over about two years while he was
OL,15,Fserving with the force.
OL,17,FOpening his trial at Southwark Crown
OL,18,FCourt, prosecutor Catherine Farrelly KC
OL,19,Fsaid Tyrrell had been trained in Sexual
OL,20,FOffences Investigation Techniques.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
